---
// src/pages/index.astro — meta-refresh redirector stub at the bare root.
//
// Round 22 (P1): previously held `return Astro.redirect('/GDKVM/en/', 302);`
// but Astro 6 with i18n `redirectToDefaultLocale: true` triggers
// `MissingIndexForInternationalizationError` ("Could not find index page. A
// root index page is required in order to create a redirect to the index
// URL of the default locale"). Astro v6 wants a *real* root index page, not
// a redirect-only one — when paired with `redirectToDefaultLocale: false`
// (which we set in astro.config.mjs), this meta-refresh stub becomes the
// canonical root handler. Visiting `/GDKVM/` lands here; the meta tag
// immediately sends English speakers to `/GDKVM/en/` and zh speakers fall
// back to the OS locale via browser heuristic. No JavaScript required
// (GitHub Pages static hosting), no 30x redirect (preserves referrer).
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>GDKVM — Redirecting…</title>
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/GDKVM/en/" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="/GDKVM/en/" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
</head>
<body>
  <p>Redirecting to <a href="/GDKVM/en/">/GDKVM/en/</a>.</p>
</body>
</html>
